<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Form 10</title><style>@page{size:A4;margin:10mm 12mm 16mm;@bottom-center{content:"Bloomwell Home Care Uganda Limited · Nest Mama Program · Page " counter(page) " of " counter(pages);font:7pt Arial,sans-serif;color:#47615E}}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#0B2E2A;font-size:8.5pt;line-height:1.35}
.hd{background:#08675F;color:#fff;padding:3mm 5mm;border-bottom:1.4mm solid #F8991E}.hd table{width:100%}.hd td{vertical-align:middle}.hd .n{font-size:12pt;font-weight:bold}.hd .s{font-size:7pt;color:#CFEAE5}.hd .r{text-align:right;font-size:7pt;color:#CFEAE5}
.tt{border:.3mm solid #08675F;background:#DDF0EC;padding:2.5mm 3mm;margin:3mm 0}.tt b{font-size:12pt;color:#08675F}.tt div{font-size:7.5pt;color:#47615E;margin-top:1mm}
h3{font-size:9pt;color:#08675F;margin:4mm 0 1.5mm;border-bottom:.3mm solid #F8991E;padding-bottom:.8mm;break-after:avoid}
table.r{width:100%;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:2mm 0;margin:0 -2mm}table.r{table-layout:fixed}
.c{vertical-align:bottom;padding-top:1.5mm}.l{display:block;font-size:6.8pt;color:#47615E}.v{display:block;border-bottom:.25mm solid #7F9A96;min-height:5.5mm;font-size:8.5pt;font-weight:bold}
.w{margin-top:1.5mm;break-inside:avoid}.w .v{border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5;border-bottom:.25mm solid #7F9A96;min-height:11mm;padding:1mm 1.5mm;font-weight:normal;background:#FBFDFC}
.cb{margin-top:1.8mm;break-inside:avoid}.cb .o{display:inline-block;margin:0 4mm 0 0;font-size:8.5pt}.cb .l{display:inline;margin-right:3mm;font-size:8pt;color:#0B2E2A;font-weight:bold}
.n{border:.3mm solid #E0B25A;background:#FFF6E3;padding:2mm 3mm;margin-top:2.5mm;font-size:7.8pt;break-inside:avoid}
p.t{margin:2mm 0;font-size:8.3pt;break-inside:avoid}
table.g{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:2mm;table-layout:fixed;break-inside:avoid}.g th{background:#08675F;color:#fff;font-size:6.8pt;padding:1.4mm;text-align:left}.g td{border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5;height:7.5mm;padding:.5mm 1.5mm;font-size:8pt}.g tr:nth-child(even) td{background:#F2F8F6}
table.s{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:3mm;table-layout:fixed;break-inside:avoid}.s th{background:#E8F2F0;font-size:6.8pt;text-align:left;padding:1.2mm;border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5}.s td{border:.25mm solid #CAD9D5;padding:1.2mm;vertical-align:top;height:15mm;font-size:7.8pt}
.s .m{font-size:6.8pt;line-height:1.5}.si{max-height:10mm;display:block}.ev{font-size:6pt;color:#47615E;margin-top:.8mm}
.idr{margin-top:1mm}thead{display:table-header-group}tr{break-inside:avoid}</style></head><body><div class="hd"><table><tr><td style="width:14mm">{{ org.mark_svg|safe }}</td><td><div class="n">BLOOMWELL HOME CARE UGANDA LIMITED</div><div class="s">Patient consent and care forms · Nest Mama Program · You rest, we care</div></td><td class="r">{{ org.city }}, Uganda<br>{{ org.phone }}</td></tr></table></div><div class="tt"><b>FORM 10. INCIDENT, EMERGENCY AND REFERRAL RECORD</b><div>Record facts promptly after an incident or emergency, the action taken, any referral or transfer, and any required reporting. This form does not replace emergency action or required reporting.</div></div><table class="r idr"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Patient full name</span><span class="v">{{ patient.name }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">DOB / age</span><span class="v">{{ patient.dob }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Patient record ID</span><span class="v">{{ patient.record_id }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Date / time</span><span class="v">{{ form.datetime }}</span></td></tr></table><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Event date / time</span><span class="v">{{ v.event_date_time or prefill.event_date_time }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Place</span><span class="v">{{ v.place or prefill.place }}</span></td></tr></table><div class="cb"><span class="l">Type:</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.type == "Deterioration" else "☐" }} Deterioration</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.type == "Medication" else "☐" }} Medication</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.type == "Fall " else "☐" }} Fall </span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.type == " injury" else "☐" }}  injury</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.type == "Safeguarding" else "☐" }} Safeguarding</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.type == "Other" else "☐" }} Other</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">What happened, observed findings and information source</span><span class="v">{{ v.what_happened_observed_findings_and_info or prefill.what_happened_observed_findings_and_info }}</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">Immediate action, time, response and persons involved</span><span class="v">{{ v.immediate_action_time_response_and_perso or prefill.immediate_action_time_response_and_perso }}</span></div><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Emergency / clinical assistance contacted</span><span class="v">{{ v.emergency_clinical_assistance_contacted or prefill.emergency_clinical_assistance_contacted }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Time</span><span class="v">{{ v.time or prefill.time }}</span></td></tr></table><div class="w"><span class="l">Advice / instructions, source and action taken</span><span class="v">{{ v.advice_instructions_source_and_action_ta or prefill.advice_instructions_source_and_action_ta }}</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">Patient or authorised representative informed; consent / refusal and time</span><span class="v">{{ v.patient_or_authorised_representative_inf or prefill.patient_or_authorised_representative_inf }}</span></div><div class="n">If urgent treatment without prior consent was necessary, record the specific circumstances, why consent could not be obtained, the lawful basis relied on and the later explanation. This is not a standing emergency consent or a resuscitation limitation.</div><div class="w"><span class="l">Basis and circumstances if applicable</span><span class="v">{{ v.basis_and_circumstances_if_applicable or prefill.basis_and_circumstances_if_applicable }}</span></div><h3>Required reporting</h3><div class="cb"><span class="l">Reportable event:</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.reportable_event == "Death (certified by a registered medical practitioner, never by the nurse)" else "☐" }} Death (certified by a registered medical practitioner, never by the nurse)</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.reportable_event == "Notifiable disease" else "☐" }} Notifiable disease</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.reportable_event == "Suspected abuse " else "☐" }} Suspected abuse </span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.reportable_event == " safeguarding concern" else "☐" }}  safeguarding concern</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.reportable_event == "Other legal or professional duty" else "☐" }} Other legal or professional duty</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.reportable_event == "None identified" else "☐" }} None identified</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">Reported to (authority, professional body or facility), by whom, and when</span><span class="v">{{ v.reported_to_authority_professional_body_ or prefill.reported_to_authority_professional_body_ }}</span></div><div class="w"><span class="l">Patient / family told what happened and what is being done</span><span class="v">{{ v.patient_family_told_what_happened_and_wh or prefill.patient_family_told_what_happened_and_wh }}</span></div><div class="cb"><span class="l">Privacy incident (lost record, misdirected message):</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.privacy_incident_lost_record_misdirected == "No" else "☐" }} No</span><span class="o">{{ "☒" if v.privacy_incident_lost_record_misdirected == "Yes, reported under Service Agreement clause 12.5" else "☐" }} Yes, reported under Service Agreement clause 12.5</span></div><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Privacy incident reported on</span><span class="v">{{ v.privacy_incident_reported_on or prefill.privacy_incident_reported_on }}</span></td></tr></table><h3>Referral and handover</h3><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Receiving facility / clinician</span><span class="v">{{ v.receiving_facility_clinician or prefill.receiving_facility_clinician }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Contact</span><span class="v">{{ v.contact or prefill.contact }}</span></td></tr></table><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Acceptance confirmed by / at</span><span class="v">{{ v.acceptance_confirmed_by_at or prefill.acceptance_confirmed_by_at }}</span></td></tr></table><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Transport / escort and departure time</span><span class="v">{{ v.transport_escort_and_departure_time or prefill.transport_escort_and_departure_time }}</span></td></tr></table><div class="w"><span class="l">Condition at transfer, medicines last given and documents sent</span><span class="v">{{ v.condition_at_transfer_medicines_last_giv or prefill.condition_at_transfer_medicines_last_giv }}</span></div><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">Handover received by / time</span><span class="v">{{ v.handover_received_by_time or prefill.handover_received_by_time }}</span></td></tr></table><div class="w"><span class="l">If transfer delayed or declined: actions and safety plan</span><span class="v">{{ v.if_transfer_delayed_or_declined_actions_ or prefill.if_transfer_delayed_or_declined_actions_ }}</span></div><table class="r"><tr><td class="c"><span class="l">BLOOMWELL notified by / to / time</span><span class="v">{{ v.bloomwell_notified_by_to_time or prefill.bloomwell_notified_by_to_time }}</span></td><td class="c"><span class="l">Follow-up owner and deadline</span><span class="v">{{ v.follow_up_owner_and_deadline or prefill.follow_up_owner_and_deadline }}</span></td></tr></table><h3>Signatures</h3><table class="s"><tr><th style="width:27mm">Role</th><th style="width:44mm">Name and details</th><th style="width:30mm">Method</th><th>Signature or thumbprint, with e-signature evidence</th><th style="width:24mm">Date / time</th></tr><tr><td><b>Clinician</b></td><td>{{ sig.nurse.name or author.name }}<div class="m">Name and UNMC number</div><div>{{ sig.nurse.detail or author.registration_line }}</div></td><td class="m">{{ "☒" if sig.nurse.method == "drawn" else "☐" }} Drawn<br>{{ "☒" if sig.nurse.method == "biometric" else "☐" }} Fingerprint / Face<br>{{ "☒" if sig.nurse.method == "password" else "☐" }} Account password<br></td><td>{% if sig.nurse.image %}<img class="si" src="{{ sig.nurse.image }}">{% endif %}<div class="ev">{{ sig.nurse.evidence }}</div></td><td>{{ sig.nurse.at }}</td></tr></table></body></html>